{"id":14463,"author":"iKronix_Gaming","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eDear Avicus Support,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eI believe I can really change to be a great member in the Avicus community. I'm not saying my ban was unfair, but I would like another chance to prove that I won't get any more infractions. It's been nearly a month since I've been on Avicus now and I miss it so much. I really would appreciate another chance to show the Avicus community what they would be missing if I wasn't here.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eI will definitely avoid combat-logging, I will be kind and helpful to all Avicus members and staff, I promise not to abuse glitches and I will not spam. I will also be a very active member of the community and will show my full support to all staff members. On the forums I will be respectful of all other players and participate in interesting discussions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eI really hope you give me another chance,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eDaCrowMan\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eDear Avicus Support,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eI believe I can really change to be a great member in the Avicus community. I'm not saying my ban was unfair, but I would like another chance to prove that I won't get any more infractions. It's been nearly a month since I've been on Avicus now and I miss it so much. I really would appreciate another chance to show the Avicus community what they would be missing if I wasn't here.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eI will definitely avoid combat-logging, I will be kind and helpful to all Avicus members and staff, I promise not to abuse glitches and I will not spam. I will also be a very active member of the community and will show my full support to all staff members. On the forums I will be respectful of all other players and participate in interesting discussions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eI really hope you give me another chance,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003eDaCrowMan\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: UICTFontTextStyleBody; font-size: 17px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"\u003e","created_at":1434868135,"title":"My ban","replies":[{"id":200587,"author":"Pelpelajax","body":"Hello,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSince you seem have learned a lesson, and you seem sorry for your actions, you will be given a final chance. If you get banned again, you will not be appealed!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards,\u003cbr\u003ePelpelajax,\u003cbr\u003eAvicus Network Senior Moderator.","body_tagged":"Hello,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSince you seem have learned a lesson, and you seem sorry for your actions, you will be given a final chance. If you get banned again, you will not be appealed!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards,\u003cbr\u003ePelpelajax,\u003cbr\u003eAvicus Network Senior Moderator.","created_at":1434910253}]}